23,24$ 23b : Disc olive or greenish black.
24,0$ 24a : Disc olive. On wood. $ Chlorencoelia. $s"Chlorencoelia."
24,0$ 24b : Disc greenish black. On cones of Picea. $ Piceomphale. $s"Piceomphale."
25,26$ 25a : Sp brown at maturity or forming small secondary sp.
25,31$ 25b : Sp hyaline, not forming secondary sp.
26,27$ 26a : Sp brown at maturity, not forming small secondary sp.
26,29$ 26b : Sp hyaline, forming small secondary sp.
27,0$ 27a : Sp rough, with a gelatinous sheath. $ See Crocicreas melanosporum.
27,28$ 27b : Sp smooth, without a gelatinous sheath.
28,0$ 28a : Apothecia disc-shaped. $ Bulgariella. $s"Bulgariella."
28,0$ 28b : Apothecia cup-shaped. $ Velutarina. $s"Velutarina."
