45,46$ 45b : Frb ± yellow, if white or whitish then sessile or sub-sessile.
46,0$ 46a : On wood or fungi. $ Bisporella. $s"Bisporella."
46,0$ 46b : On herbaceous stems or ferns. $ Allophylaria. $s"Allophylaria."
